{"title":"Sirocco","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 40 Dust Devil that attacks with corrode (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 6 times (3.3% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: mireChance: .35</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/sirocco-core\">Sirocco Core</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sirocco\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sirocco?lv=39\">Lv 39 <span>70</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sirocco?lv=40\">Lv 40 <span>88</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/sirocco?lv=41\">Lv 41 <span>11</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sirocco?lv=39\" title=\"Pick level 39\"><td><b>39</b></td><td>185</td><td>26</td><td>1,950</td><td class=\"muted\">555 · 36.4 · 5,850</td><td>70</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Avenue\">Sunken Avenue</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sirocco?lv=40\" title=\"Pick level 40\"><td><b>40</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>194</td><td>26.5</td><td>2,000</td><td class=\"muted\">582 · 37.1 · 6,000</td><td>88</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Avenue\">Sunken Avenue</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/sirocco\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>41</b></td><td>203</td><td>27.1</td><td>2,050</td><td class=\"muted\">609 · 37.9 · 6,150</td><td>11</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Avenue\">Sunken Avenue</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"sirocco\" data-map-level=\"41\">Show level 41 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 2 recorded drops, 411 total, 187–224 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2 drops</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Avenue\">Sunken Avenue</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 42 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Storm-Buried%20Caravan\">Storm-Buried Caravan</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 20 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Vanguard%20Camp\">Thak Vanguard Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 16 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Camp\">Thak Scout Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 12 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sun%20King's%20Tomb\">Sun King&#39;s Tomb</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 6 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Boneyard%20Roost\">Boneyard Roost</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 6 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2122, 734 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Behemoth's%20Wallow\">Behemoth&#39;s Wallow</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"sirocco\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/the-howling-sirocco\"><img src=\"data/img/09b45d3b4d34c05d314b.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>The Howling Sirocco</b><span>Lv 40</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Dust Devil: <a href=\"#/monster/dust-devil\">Dust Devil</a> <span class=\"muted\">(34)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/sand-devil\">Sand Devil</a> <span class=\"muted\">(37)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/09b45d3b4d34c05d314b.webp\" alt=\"Sirocco\"></div><h3>Sirocco</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>41</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 40)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Dust Devil</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>corrode · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>203</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>27.1</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,050</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>183 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}